===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|da}} {{term|Eiríkr|lang=da}}. Borne by eight kings of Denmark.

===Proper noun===
{{head|da|proper noun}}

# {{given name|male|lang=da}}.

====Related terms====
* (''feminine form'') {{l|da|Erika}}
* (''surnames'') {{l|da|Eriksen}}

===References===
